<title>SWEDEN: SOCCER-PORTO 2 GOTHENBURG 0 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTO 2 GOTHENBURG 0 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>GOTHENBURG, Sweden 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Porto beat IFK Gothenburg 2-0 (half-time 0-0) in a European Champions' league group D match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Porto - Mario Jardel 64, Edmilson 89</p>
<p>Attendance - 19,448</p>
